  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Progama Rodoviario II de Baha</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roadway Program II of the State of Bahia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS PROGRAM INVOLVES THE EXECUTION OF WORKS IN APPROXIMATELY 2,000 KM OF ROADWAYS. WORKS INCLUDE: 500 KM OF NEW PAVEMENT; 680 KM OF EXISTING ROAD REHABILITATION; AND 820 KM OF PERIODIC MAINTENANCE. OTHER COMPONENTS WOULD BE THE ADQUISICION OF EMERGENCY MAINTENANCE EQUIPMENT, ENGINEERING AND TRAFIC SAFETY DEVICES, AS WELL AS WEIGHT CONTROL EQUIPMENT. SOME INSTITUTIONAL STRENGHTENING AND TRAINING WOULD ALSO BE REQUIRED.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
